      "id": "addon-0-3-90-players-tab",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "area": "addon",
      "title": "Find guildmates on your quests",
      "notes": [
        "The new Players tab in /hmc lists the guildmates who share your quests or are in your zone, online first, and groups the guild's dungeon quests by dungeon.",
        "Quest logs are shared live between guildmates who run the addon, and a member's sheet has Whisper and Invite buttons."
      ],
      "version": "0.3.90",
      "link": {
        "href": "https://github.com/royaux70/hotel-motel-colibri-downloads/releases/tag/uploader-v0.3.90",
