      "id": "addon-0-3-90-world-map-guildmates",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "area": "addon",
      "title": "Guildmates on the world map",
      "notes": [
        "Online guildmates show as dots in their class colors on the world map, and members seen in the last 48 hours show dimmer. Hover for the quests you share; click for their sheet."
